{"version":1,"content":"<p>《萬千星輝賀台慶》「炫舞女王」由陳煒、傅嘉莉、姚子羚、陳敏之領軍，率領26位女藝員包括關嘉敏、葉蒨文、古佩雯、黃嘉雯等大跳熱舞，陳敏之、傅嘉莉大騷長腿，姚子羚則跳士的舞，大家都跳得有板有眼，壓軸跳最後的陳煒甚受歡迎，脫去外套時，更引來不少歡</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:18:28.360666+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:54:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:45.428984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:45.428984+00:00","content_hash":"330eb751873c2469943eb4d38ca40b2419066a544b24cedee9ec3ff521a8775c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}